      "body": "## Purpose\n\nFix an `AttributeError` when `SpecDecodeBaseProposer.load_model()` initializes an MTP draft for `Glm5NextForConditionalGeneration`:\n\n```text\nAttributeError: 'Glm5NextConfig' object has no attribute 'image_token_index'\n```\n\n`Glm5NextConfig` defines `image_token_id`, but GLM is missing from the existing mapping branch. Add its class name so the draft receives the target's image token ID instead of attempting to read the nonexistent `image_token_index`. This changes initialization only; MTP computation and target/draft weight sharing are unchanged.\n\nSearches for GLM image-token mapping fixes found no overlapping open PR. The related GLM DFlash2 (#56983) and pipeline-parallel (#57171) changes do not modify this proposer mapping.\n\n## Test Plan\n\nRun the existing proposer tests:\n\n```bash\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=\"\" python -m pytest \\\n  tests/v1/spec_decode/test_llm_base_proposer.py -v --tb=short\n```\n\nThe GLM loading regression calls the complete `load_model()` method with the real GLM configuration and model classes, supplying small weight modules at the checkpoint-loading boundary. It verifies image-token mapping, embedding/LM-head sharing, and that the target configuration remains unchanged.\n\nCheck the changed production file:\n\n```bash\npre-commit run --hook-stage manual --files \\\n  vllm/v1/spec_decode/llm_base_proposer.py\n```\n\n## Test Result\n\nLinux CPU, Python 3.10.12, PyTorch 2.11.0+cu130; tested against `a4eb3f25` with and without the fix.\n\n- Before: **1 failed, 3 passed**. The GLM loading regression raises the `AttributeError` above; the three existing attention-initialization tests pass.\n- After: **4 passed**, including the GLM image-token mapping and embedding/LM-head sharing checks.\n- The existing proposer suite also passes unchanged: **3 passed**.\n- Pre-commit checks pass for the changed production file, including Ruff and mypy for Python 3.10–3.13.\n\nGLM-5.3-Flash has also run successfully on MetaX GPUs with our downstream patch bundle, which includes this fix.\n\nThe fix was developed with assistance from GPT-6. The changes have been reviewed by a human.\n\n",
